    en: 'Naamkaran is done in an auspicious muhurat — a good tithi, nakshatra, weekday and lagna. It is usually held on the 11th/12th day after birth (as the sutak ends) or on an auspicious day per family custom. A qualified purohit checks the birth-nakshatra to fix the name-syllable and the muhurat. Use the button below to check the Naamkaran muhurat right here in the app.',
